    <h2>Work</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>2025–Present: Building an AI scientist at <a href="https://periodic.com/">Periodic Labs</a></li>
      <li>2023–24: Implemented <a href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/13mX0gEpC6gdQWCFdn_d4LUBoTE1T7CipBDqz6exKDWI/edit?usp=sharing">large-scale pre-training infrastructure in Rust</a>, pre-trained distributed Transformer foundation models across 8,000 GPUs and TRNs. Data, tensor, pipeline, and expert parallelism. Applying to LLM self-play and self-improvement with code generation.</li>
