    <p>I'm additionally interested in information theory, security (vulnerabilities, <a href="https://github.com/xanderdunn/polygon_hack_repro">exploits</a>), and trees (the plant kind, not the balanced kind). I think Moravec's Paradox and the Bitter Lesson are two of the most important empirical realizations in AI.</p>

